# Boot and restore the anchor save produced by anchor_after_opening.xit:
# the state at the end of the Mundania opening, for about a tenth of the
# instructions a full replay of the route costs (~1.2 billion vs ~20).
#
# This is NOT the same path as lib/restore_slot1.xit. When a *.SAV is
# present in the save directory the game offers to restore it during boot,
# with its own "Restore?" Yes/No box -- buttons measured from the rendered
# dialogue at (160,95) and (160,110). That prompt does not appear on the
# mid-game system-menu route, so the two need separate fragments.
#
# Answering Yes opens the ordinary Restore Game dialogue: slot list with the
# first row at (100,78), and Ok / Delete / Cancel along the bottom with Ok
# at (65,168).

include boot.xit

move 160 95
run 10
click left
run 60
move 100 78
run 10
click left
run 30
move 65 168
run 10
click left
run 90
move 305 196
run 20
